# Astro — Local Mode (PGlite, no auth, all localhost)
# Activate with: npm run dev:local
#
# Local mode requires NO configuration.
# PGlite (Postgres-in-WASM) runs in-process, no Docker or external DB needed.
# Authentication is disabled — single-user, no passkeys.
#
# This file exists for documentation only.
# Running `npm run env:local` removes .env.local so defaults take effect.
#
# The only variables that apply in local mode come from .env (shared secrets),
# which are optional for local dev — any placeholder values work.
#
# If you want to override anything (rare), create .env.local with:

# --- Optional overrides ---
# RELAY_PORT=3002
# RELAY_JWT_SECRET=any-string-works-locally
